  "fs1": {
   "x": 1419,
   "y": 1150,
   "w": 420,
   "size": "m",
   "fill": "green",
   "page": "p034",
   "text": "Partners switch, so it's about you. Decided Nov 19: the day goes to whoever wins the most stretches; points break ties. Matches shows the stretch you're in now."
  },
  "fs2": {
   "x": 1419,
   "y": 2300,
   "w": 420,
   "size": "m",
   "fill": "green",
   "page": "p034",
   "text": "Carts are teams: carts ranked, then the matches that made the score. The bar's middle line is always half the points, labeled with what wins."
  },
  "fs3": {
   "x": 1419,
   "y": 3450,
   "w": 420,
   "size": "m",
   "fill": "green",
   "page": "p034",
   "text": "One match is the whole game: Ryder Cup's card, holes counted as points, 9½ to win. Matches is the hole calendar. 8 players = two of these."
  },
